      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "A forest plot per metric: the dot is the caller's precision or recall against the truth set, the bar its 95% confidence interval, so two callers whose bars overlap are not distinguishable on this truth set. Sorting and value labels sit in the tile header. The intervals come from the true and false positive counts that hap.py or vcfeval report in nf-core/variantbenchmarking.\n",
